WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.534
-Ukrainian president
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:05.567
delivered a virtual address
to Congress today

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:08.634
as Vladimir Putin's invasion
of Ukraine continued to sputter,

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:09.934
leaving hope that there can be

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.734
a diplomatic solution
to the conflict.

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:14.000
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:20.667
Zelenskyy delivered
a deeply moving

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.701
and impassioned address
to Congress today

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.968
and received
a bipartisan show of support,

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:28.300
including a standing ovation
the moment he appeared on-screen

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.968
before he even said a word.

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.834
[ Applause ]

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.200
I can say with
absolute certainty

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.767
that's the warmest reception

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:43.200
anyone has ever received
on Zoom.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.167
I wish I got a reaction
like that from my staff

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:46.367
when I joined a virtual meeting.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.267
Most of the time
they have me muted,

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:51.100
which becomes clear
when it's their turn to talk.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.367
Okay, Emily,
let's hear what you have.

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:56.434
Emily? Emily?

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.467
Emily, can you --
Emily, I see you looking --

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.801
Emily.
Emily.

00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:03.033
Emily, did someone just
serve you a hamburger?

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:07.133
Are you --
Emily, are you at a restaurant?

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.601
Or even worse, when a member of
my staff Zooms into a meeting --

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:16.367
and again, this is a 100% real
screenshot -- from their bed.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:20.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:22.400
Like our cue card guy Wally did

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.834
during a "respect in
the workplace" training.

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:29.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.634
And just to confirm,
that is Wally and not,

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.767
as I originally thought,
Wally's thumb on the lens.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:39.868
In fact, we drew a face
on a thumb

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:41.534
just to see what
that would look like.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:48.868
That paid off.

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:50.234
Zelenskyy asked the U.S.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.434
to continue ramping up
the pressure on Russia

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:54.267
to stop its barbaric
and illegal war,

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:57.200
including by imposing
even more punishing sanctions

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.968
on Russian oligarchs
and officials.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:03.801
-New packages of sanctions
are needed constantly every week

00:02:03.801 --> 00:02:07.634
until the Russian
military machine stops.

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.267
Restrictions are needed
for everyone

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:14.901
on whom this unjust regime
is based.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.067
We propose
that the United States

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:21.033
sanction all politicians
in the Russian Federation

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:23.834
who remain in their offices

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:29.534
and do not cut ties with those
who are responsible

00:02:29.534 --> 00:02:31.467
for the aggression
against Ukraine.

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:33.033
-And you can understand
why Zelenskyy

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:34.667
is calling
for additional sanctions,

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:36.834
because the ones
we've already imposed

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:38.434
have squeezed Russia's economy.

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.734
They've been cut off from the
international banking system.

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:42.534
Oligarchs are having
their yachts seized.

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:45.033
Even fast-food chains
like Pizza Hut and KFC

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.234
are pulling out of the country.

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:47.534
This KFC, by the way.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:50.901
They still have the other KFC,
Kamchatka Fried Chicken.

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:55.968
Their secret recipe
is one spice, and it's sawdust.

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:56.968
Their slogan is...

00:03:00.367 --> 00:03:01.601
And as we mentioned,

00:03:01.601 --> 00:03:03.234
Russian oligarchs
are feeling the pain, too.

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.167
In fact, today "The New York
Times" reported that...

00:03:18.534 --> 00:03:21.367
First of all, I've never heard
of a more perfect description

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:24.667
of a Russian oligarch --
a former KGB agent

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:27.801
who made his money
off nickel mining.

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:29.267
The only way
it could be more perfect

00:03:29.267 --> 00:03:34.167
is if he got his start holding
Ivan Drago's spit bucket.

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:36.367
Norway should seize the yacht
and do something fun with it.

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:38.267
Maybe they could add
a buffet and a casino

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:40.000
and make it part
in Norwegian Cruise Lines.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.534
There's no better way
to punish a sleazy rich guy

00:03:42.534 --> 00:03:44.734
than turning their yacht into
a cruise ship for the masses.

00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:46.334
[ Russian accent ] Vladimir,
you have to stop this war.

00:03:46.334 --> 00:03:50.000
American tourists are walking
all over my yacht in flip-flops.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.400
A yacht is no place
for flipping and flopping.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:55.200
[ Normal voice ]
So the consequences for Russia

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.067
have been intense,
and there's likely more coming.

00:03:57.067 --> 00:03:59.767
On top of that, it seems
like Putin did not expect

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:01.634
that his barbaric invasion
of Ukraine

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:03.934
would go this badly
or take this long.

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:05.467
As one report put it yesterday,

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:08.767
Putin thought Russia's military
could capture Kyiv in two days,

00:04:08.767 --> 00:04:09.834
but it still hasn't in 20,

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:11.701
which explains the new law
he passed

00:04:11.701 --> 00:04:15.934
that changes the entire month
of March to one day.

00:04:15.934 --> 00:04:17.567
In Russia,
it's always Monday now.

00:04:17.567 --> 00:04:20.968
That's why the Russian Garfield
is always so miserable.

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:22.300
Also, they're out of lasagna.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:27.033
So he was forced to eat
Kamchatka Fried Chicken.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:30.300
Putin clearly didn't expect such
stiff resistance from Ukraine.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.934
And there are
several reasons for that.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:33.234
But one may be that...

00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:43.434
That doesn't surprise me.

00:04:43.434 --> 00:04:46.000
You think anyone around Putin
ever gives him bad news?

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.667
[ Russian accent ] Does my butt
look big in these pants?

00:04:47.667 --> 00:04:50.334
Remember,
I know where family lives.

00:04:50.334 --> 00:04:52.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.767
[ Normal voice ]
He probably thinks his
childhood dog is still alive.

00:04:54.767 --> 00:04:56.167
[ Russian accent ]
My advisers tell me Gorky

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:57.400
went to live at farm upstate.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.367
He is now 57, very successful,

00:05:00.367 --> 00:05:02.701
owns nickel mine,
has superyacht.

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:04.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:04.734 --> 00:05:07.167
[ Normal voice ]
Just take a look at the faces
on his most senior officials

00:05:07.167 --> 00:05:09.000
whenever he has to meet
with them in public.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.434
I mean, that's not the vibe
of a group of people

00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:15.567
who've just been told, "There
are no wrong answers here."

00:05:15.567 --> 00:05:16.868
Last time I looked around a room

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:18.667
and saw facial expressions
like that,

00:05:18.667 --> 00:05:20.567
I was at my
gastroenterologist's office.

00:05:20.567 --> 00:05:22.534
And, by the way,
I can make colonoscopy jokes now

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:24.667
because I'm 48,
which used to surprise people,

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:25.767
you know, before COVID.

00:05:25.767 --> 00:05:26.968
I mean, look at me
from back then.

00:05:26.968 --> 00:05:29.033
I looked like
the kid from "Belfast," and...

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:30.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:34.133
...now I look like the grandpa
from "Belfast."

00:05:34.133 --> 00:05:37.300
I never got to meet
Jamie Dornan in Belfast.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.467
I said to my wife, "Do
you think I look a little
bit like Jamie Dornan?"

00:05:39.467 --> 00:05:41.400
And she said,
"After what happened to him?"

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:49.734 --> 00:05:52.167
Anyway, Putin obviously
does not tolerate dissent.

00:05:52.167 --> 00:05:54.367
And now he's overseeing
a vicious crackdown

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:55.667
on free speech in Russia,

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:57.534
which is why it was so shocking
and courageous

00:05:57.534 --> 00:05:59.634
when an employee
of Russian state TV

00:05:59.634 --> 00:06:01.067
interrupted a broadcast
this week

00:06:01.067 --> 00:06:02.734
to protest the war live on air.

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:04.434
-The Russian journalist
who held up a sign

00:06:04.434 --> 00:06:06.901
in the middle of a show that
read, in part, "Stop the war.

00:06:06.901 --> 00:06:10.367
Do not believe propaganda.
They tell you lies here."

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:12.968
And, "Russians against war."

00:06:12.968 --> 00:06:16.000
-The program appeared
to quickly cut away to video.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.400
-Yeah, I bet they cut away.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.934
They cut away faster
than "SNL" did

00:06:18.934 --> 00:06:21.501
when Ashlee Simpson
was busted lip-synching.

00:06:21.501 --> 00:06:24.868
Lorne Michaels still
doesn't know that happened.

00:06:24.868 --> 00:06:26.133
And if you're thinking,
"Well, now he does,

00:06:26.133 --> 00:06:27.834
because you just said it,"
I'm sorry to tell you,

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:30.801
Lorne doesn't even know
this show exists.

00:06:30.801 --> 00:06:32.734
He still thinks Colin Jost
is subbing for me

00:06:32.734 --> 00:06:35.167
while I'm on my honeymoon.

00:06:35.167 --> 00:06:36.501
But, I mean, look at that.

00:06:36.501 --> 00:06:38.434
That is an incredibly
brave protest,

00:06:38.434 --> 00:06:39.901
knowing the likely consequences.

00:06:39.901 --> 00:06:42.667
In fact, it's hard to fully
grasp just how brave that is

00:06:42.667 --> 00:06:45.534
because we take free speech
for granted here.

00:06:45.534 --> 00:06:48.067
Usually the only interruptions
from someone holding a sign

00:06:48.067 --> 00:06:49.934
on this show are from Wally.

00:06:49.934 --> 00:06:51.234
-Did I hear my name?

00:06:51.234 --> 00:06:52.968
-What?

00:06:52.968 --> 00:06:56.300
What in the world does
"Use promo code 'Wally'" mean?

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.801
-Seth, I have a new sponsorship
with a mattress company,

00:06:58.801 --> 00:07:02.400
thanks to that Zoom photo
of me in bed blowing up.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.767
-What mattress company?

00:07:03.767 --> 00:07:06.534
-I'm glad you asked.
It's called MyMattress Guy.

00:07:06.534 --> 00:07:09.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:09.968 --> 00:07:11.501
-Oh, good. Yeah.
Encourage him.

00:07:11.501 --> 00:07:15.434
That'll be helpful.
Do, by all means, encourage him.

00:07:15.434 --> 00:07:16.901
The point is, unlike Wally,

00:07:16.901 --> 00:07:19.033
that was an incredibly
courageous act of protest.

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:21.501
In fact, to give you an idea
of how bad it's gotten,

00:07:21.501 --> 00:07:24.968
a Russian newspaper tweeted
a photo of the protest.

00:07:24.968 --> 00:07:28.067
But thanks to Russia's
extreme new censorship laws,

00:07:28.067 --> 00:07:29.767
this is what it looked like.

00:07:29.767 --> 00:07:31.167
I mean, look at that.

00:07:31.167 --> 00:07:34.267
Putin wants you to think someone
interrupted a state TV broadcast

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:38.234
to hold up a giant
blank piece of paper.

00:07:38.234 --> 00:07:40.868
The only time I've ever seen
an actual blank piece of paper

00:07:40.868 --> 00:07:43.067
on national TV like that
was when Trump pretended

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:46.334
he was signing a bill
or writing one of his speeches.

00:07:46.334 --> 00:07:49.334
Remember that, when he posed --
posed for a photo

00:07:49.334 --> 00:07:52.133
and pretended he was writing
his own inaugural address

00:07:52.133 --> 00:07:53.334
with a Sharpie?

00:07:53.334 --> 00:07:55.934
A Sharpie.

00:07:55.934 --> 00:07:58.300
Are you writing a speech
or labeling your lunch

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.167
for the office fridge?

00:08:01.167 --> 00:08:03.534
Looks like an author photo
on a dust cover

00:08:03.534 --> 00:08:06.000
for a book called
"Business Acting 101."

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:07.334 --> 00:08:08.634
Putin clearly miscalculated,

00:08:08.634 --> 00:08:10.901
in part because he's so isolated
from reality.

00:08:10.901 --> 00:08:13.100
Now the blowback
has been so intense,

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.434
Russia has been cut off from
the global financial system,

00:08:15.434 --> 00:08:17.200
and even fast-food chains
are pulling out.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.167
So if you go to a KFC in Moscow

00:08:19.167 --> 00:08:20.834
and they tell you
it's definitely chicken,

00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:22.133
just remember their new slogan.

00:08:22.133 --> 00:08:23.868
-"They tell you lies here."

00:08:23.868 --> 00:08:25.834
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:29.534 --> 00:08:31.234
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:08:31.234 --> 00:08:33.868
over 2 million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:08:33.868 --> 00:08:36.567
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,
and other serious illnesses.

00:08:36.567 --> 00:08:38.067
And they need your help
now more than ever.

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:40.033
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:42.634
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

